title: "Servedeck: a systemd control plane, OpenAI-compatible gateway and live dashboard for native vLLM"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Rahul
    family-names: Kumar
    alias: pctablet505
version: "0.1.0"
url: "https://servedeck.rlalphalabs.com/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/pctablet505/servedeck"
license: MIT
abstract: "Servedeck runs each local vLLM model as its own systemd user unit on one Linux GPU workstation, serves one OpenAI-compatible /v1 endpoint that answers to the name main, and shows live KV-cache use and throughput on a local dashboard."
keywords:
  - vllm
  - llm serving
  - systemd
  - kv cache
  - openai-compatible gateway
  - local llm
